extends /specs/page-structure/layout.jade

block content
    h1 Transplant
    p Moving elements around inside the dom

    section.source_section
        h2 Default set-up
        p Use HTML attributes to control the Transplant Plugin. Not all attributes are required. The ones that are, are noted.
        p By default, the plugin will transfer the element to the target element. By changing the direction, you can do the opposite.

        h3 Transplant Attributes to be added to the div that you want to move

        code.src-js.source_visible.source_example
            |   "data-toggle": "transplant", (required)
            |   "data-target": ".header__nav", // The div you want to move to or from. It could be class, id of the target div (required)
            |   "data-direction": "to|from", // Select whether you want to move the widget to another (to) or move another to this (from). Default: 'to'
            |   "data-transplant": "nav", // The elements you want to move could be "self" which means that you want to move div its self, or could be class, id, or tag name of a child element (required)
            |   "data-transplant-order": "1" // The order
            |   "data-remove": "false" // Remove original element if true
            |   "data-targetClass": "targetCustomClass" // Custom classes to be added to original elements
            |   "data-classNames": "clonedCustomClass" // Custom classes to be added to cloned elements

        markdown
            p you can order the divs you moved inside the same target by using `data-transplant-order` attribute, it takes a integer value start from "0"

        h3 Code example

        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            |   <div data-toggle="transplant" data-target=".header__nav" data-transplant="nav" data-transplant-order="1">
            |       <nav role="navigation" >
            |           .....
            |       </nav>
            |   </div>
            |   <div data-toggle="transplant" data-target=".header__nav" data-transplant="nav" data-transplant-order="0">
            |       <nav role="navigation" >
            |           .....
            |       </nav>
            |   </div>

    section.source_section
